        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset CN, Simple Cameron Knobset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe classic lines enhance the styling of the Cameron Knob to make it a great choice for many design intents. For 1-3/4 inch or 1-3/8 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Kwikset CN Knob fits most pre-drilled doors. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Kwikset Cameron Door Knob Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits pre-drilled doors.</li>\r\n<li>SmartKey Anti-pick system (on Keyed Entry function).</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacture Lifetime Mechanical & Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Kwikset Cameron Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-3/8\" up to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selection a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> An inactive knob for use as a pull or to match trim. This non-operational knob is for one side of the door. Complete Set - 1 knob and 1 rose.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Turnbutton on interior knob engages privacy lock on both knobs; emergency release hole is on exterior knob. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the knob from the interior. Complete set - 2 knobs, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Cameron Door Knob Set, Kwikset CN",
                "description": "Kwikset CN, Cameron Knobset - The classic lines enhance the styling of the Cameron Knob to make it a great choice for many design intents. For 1-3/4 inch or 1-3/8 inch door thicknesses with an adjustable backset for 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches. The Kwikset CN Knob fits most pre-drilled doors. It is available in four functions including half dummy, passage, privacy, and keyed entry with an ANSI/BHMA A156.2 grade 2 security rating.\r\n",
